{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Puppet Saurus&quot; is a two-player co-op action game that you control a kaiju by pulling him.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Control by 2 players</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2455220/extras/27a84012da4eec85678b011cf070b2c8.poster.avif?t=1771684833\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2455220/extras/27a84012da4eec85678b011cf070b2c8.webm?t=1771684833\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2455220/extras/27a84012da4eec85678b011cf070b2c8.mp4?t=1771684833\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your companions are slightly ugly but cute kaiju.<br>To control them, you need to divide up the roles, such as one person moving the legs and the other shooting fireballs.<br>Work together in unison!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Flashy kaiju actions</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2455220/extras/291ee5dc5a9d6494bcdfd5149f31de5f.poster.avif?t=1771684833\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2455220/extras/291ee5dc5a9d6494bcdfd5149f31de5f.webm?t=1771684833\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2455220/extras/291ee5dc5a9d6494bcdfd5149f31de5f.mp4?t=1771684833\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By pulling the kaiju, you can perform various actions.<br>Defeat enemies, eat and carry things, shoot lasers, etc.<br>Use a variety of actions to clear the game!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2455220?t=1771684833","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2455220?t=1771684833","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2455220/8376a29aea622cdb9ba983d9809e997960bf0963/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771684833","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2455220/8376a29aea622cdb9ba983d9809e997960bf0963/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771684833","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Puppet Saurus&quot; is a two-player co-op action game that you control a kaiju by pulling him.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Control by 2 players</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2455220/extras/27a84012da4eec85678b011cf070b2c8.poster.avif?t=1771684833\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2455220/extras/27a84012da4eec85678b011cf070b2c8.webm?t=1771684833\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2455220/extras/27a84012da4eec85678b011cf070b2c8.mp4?t=1771684833\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your companions are slightly ugly but cute kaiju.<br>To control them, you need to divide up the roles, such as one person moving the legs and the other shooting fireballs.<br>Work together in unison!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Flashy kaiju actions</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_c